    'privacy.hCollect': 'Data we do not collect',
    'privacy.pCollect': 'There is no developer server receiving accounts, analytics events, advertising IDs, or crash dossiers. The app does not embed a tracking SDK and does not track across apps.',
    'privacy.hLocal': 'What stays on your device',
    'privacy.pLocal': 'API keys, transcripts, recordings, settings, and session history stay on your device by default. On iOS, keys are stored in the system keychain; you can clear them at any time. Unless you export or share something, that content never reaches us. We have nowhere to receive it.',
